scale of the dendrogram heights).
\item Fuzzy clustering (\code{"membership"}): membership degrees that minimize the
objective function of \code{\link[cluster:fanny]{cluster::fanny()}} for the new respondent, with
the memberships of the original sample fixed. With the membership
